# CRT gap partition "env" (src/rl_crt_env.c): synthetic carriers for the locale / environment / wide-char / file paths
# (docs/findings/crt-gap-env.md). Frame 1700 = the strategic map, debug heap live. `$name` = what the call line ending in ` @name` returned.
# Locale state retail never enters ("C" locale: __lc_handle[LC_CTYPE] 0, __mb_cur_max 1, SBCS mbctype, the NLS A
# APIs) is set with memset rows (rl_crt_4c2200) and put back after; FILE streams are _iob slots 5..8 filled the same
# way (+ parse_cmdline rl_crt_4c9570 to store a heap pointer into a FILE field). Retail names in the comments.
scenario newgame-playnow

